WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:03.180
I'm a supervisor at a production plant.

00:00:03.820 --> 00:00:08.508
Now, I have bad hearing, probably
because of years and years and years

00:00:08.548 --> 00:00:13.700
of working around extremely loud
machines and not wearing ear protection.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:17.180
So I have hearing loss and tinnitus.

00:00:17.800 --> 00:00:22.584
Now it's usually not much of a problem
when I'm working in the plant, you know,

00:00:22.624 --> 00:00:27.600
we use lots of hand gestures to talk
to each other because it's loud anyway.

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:30.047
And, of course, since I'm a supervisor,

00:00:30.087 --> 00:00:33.960
I don't really have to have too
much conversation with people.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.640
I just tell them what to do.

00:00:35.680 --> 00:00:39.386
As long as they nod and understand
that, then we're good to go.

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.772
But the problem comes in when
I actually have to go up

00:00:43.812 --> 00:00:47.780
to the offices and talk
to my bosses about what's going on.

00:00:47.820 --> 00:00:52.625
And it can be kind of embarrassing
for me because sitting in a room full

00:00:52.665 --> 00:00:57.888
of people who are your bosses and asking
them to constantly repeat themselves

00:00:57.928 --> 00:01:03.840
because I don't understand what they're
saying, it can be embarrassing for me.

00:01:04.840 --> 00:01:11.420
So after my last review, they asked me
to get my hearing loss or my hearing checked.

00:01:11.540 --> 00:01:14.480
And it turned out that I do
have some hearing loss.

00:01:14.520 --> 00:01:16.996
Now, they have a lot
of respect for me because I've

00:01:17.036 --> 00:01:20.820
been doing what I do for years
and I'm very good at it.

00:01:20.860 --> 00:01:25.040
But they were very good at working
with me to get hearing aids.

00:01:25.840 --> 00:01:29.940
So it's been a major
improvement in my life.

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:33.700
The hearing aids have
a special tinnitus function.

00:01:33.740 --> 00:01:39.105
So I can play sound enriching
noises through my hearing aids,

00:01:39.145 --> 00:01:43.880
which can kind of help
with the irritation of tinnitus.

00:01:43.920 --> 00:01:49.842
And it also brings in more
noise from my environment

00:01:49.882 --> 00:01:53.800
when it needs that function as well.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.356
So just bringing in more noise
of what people are saying to me,

00:01:57.396 --> 00:02:01.680
what's going on in my environment can
also help cancel out the tinnitus.

00:02:03.140 --> 00:02:09.317
So I've definitely talked to all
of my coworkers at the plant about wearing

00:02:09.357 --> 00:02:15.540
ear protection because I just tell them,
you don't want to end up like me.
